Michael Durjan — Founder & CEO of Niiche Co. (Texas, USA)

Michael Durjan (Michael Sunjay Durjan) is a Texas-based microbiologist, strategy specialist, and Founder & CEO of **Niiche Co. Operating out of Texas, his research and executive work focus on biocompatible materials engineering, bio-based polymers, microbial biofilm mechanics, and circular product architecture.

